  </tr>

  <tr>
    <td>TC_NAV_005</td>
    <td>Navigation</td>
    <td>Reset App State</td>
    <td>Medium</td>
    <td>Regression</td>
    <td>User is logged in as standard_user. Products page is displayed.</td>
    <td class="wrap">1. Login with standard_user credentials.<br>2. Add "Sauce Labs Backpack" to the cart.<br>3. Verify the cart badge shows 1.<br>4. Click the hamburger menu icon to open the sidebar.<br>5. Click "Reset App State" in the sidebar.<br>6. Close the sidebar menu.<br>7. Observe the cart badge.</td>
    <td class="wrap">Product: Sauce Labs Backpack</td>
    <td class="wrap">1. After adding the item, cart badge shows 1.<br>2. After resetting app state, cart badge shows 0 (or is not displayed).</td>
