  <tr>
    <td>TC_E2E_001</td>
    <td>End-to-End</td>
    <td>Full Happy Path - Complete Purchase Flow</td>
    <td>Critical</td>
    <td>Smoke</td>
    <td>Browser is open. SauceDemo login page is loaded.</td>
    <td class="wrap">1. Navigate to https://www.saucedemo.com.<br>2. Login with valid credentials.<br>3. Verify the Products page is displayed.<br>4. Add "Sauce Labs Backpack" to the cart.<br>5. Add "Sauce Labs Bike Light" to the cart.<br>6. Verify cart badge shows 2.<br>7. Click the shopping cart icon.<br>8. Verify cart contains 2 items.<br>9. Click "Checkout".<br>10. Enter shipping info: First Name = "Test", Last Name = "User", Zip Code = "12345".<br>11. Click "Continue".<br>12. Verify checkout overview shows 2 items.<br>13. Verify total = subtotal + tax.<br>14. Click "Finish".<br>15. Verify order confirmation page is displayed.<br>16. Verify confirmation header shows "Thank you for your order!".<br>17. Click "Back Home".<br>18. Verify the Products page is displayed.</td>
    <td class="wrap">Username: standard_user<br>Password: secret_sauce<br>Products: Sauce Labs Backpack, Sauce Labs Bike Light<br>First Name: Test<br>Last Name: User<br>Zip Code: 12345</td>
    <td class="wrap">1. Login succeeds, Products page is displayed.<br>2. Both items are added; cart badge shows 2.<br>3. Cart page shows 2 items.<br>4. Shipping info form accepts input, navigates to checkout overview.<br>5. Checkout overview shows 2 items with correct total (subtotal + tax).<br>6. Order confirmation page displays "Thank you for your order!".<br>7. Clicking "Back Home" returns to the Products page.</td>
    <td></td>
  </tr>

